# Case of the Gateway Express: "To solve — Three or more creatures attacked this turn." and "Solved — Creatures you control get +1/+0." (CR 719.3a, 702.169b). Bot1 attacks on turn 3
# with three Memnite and only then, in its second main phase, casts the Case: it was not there when they attacked, and the condition looks at the turn, not at the Case. Unsolved
# when it enters (the Memnite are 1/1), it becomes solved at the beginning of Bot1's end step, and from then on its Memnite are 2/1 and Bot2's Memnite stays 1/1.

